    "overview": "Compare Favourite IPMECD-3141-RV4-LCD Folding Arm All-in-one Barrier Key Points • Barrier arms need to be purchased separately. • All-in-one design, easy deployment, inventory reduction • Flexible Solution: Springless design, adaptive to more arm lengths, covering multi-scenarios • 120+ countries license plate recognition • See better: 4 MP HD camera with max. 2688 × 1520@25 fps. High quality imaging with 1/1.8’ progressive scan CMOS. 0.001 lux low illumination with clearer imaging at night. Patented window defogging technology ensures the 98% detection accuracy during various conditions. • Flexible solutions adaptable to different arm lengths and wide-range telescopic arm • Enhanced durability: Adopts brush-less DC motor with 6 million lifespan, carbon steel gear, and multiple anti-smash modes such as IR, loop, radars to extend the barrier service life. Built-in DC12V output, can directly power external devices • Integrated LCD Display: Real-Time ID & Data Visualization. • Safer & Secure: Instantly spot unauthorized vehicles and identify critical details like vehicle brand, color, license status, etc. • User-friendly: Supports remote control within 50m. The barrier arm supports obstacle contact rebound, and auto-on when power outage. Sales Enquiry Datasheet",
